  "body": "Auction: 8-12 The Promenade, Takapuna on Wednesday 4 November 2026 at 9:30AM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nSpace for the family. Flexibility for the future. The beach, cafés and everything Browns Bay has to offer are just moments away.\r\n\r\nWelcome to 2/12 Philson Terrace—a home where generous living, beautiful outdoor spaces and versatile accommodation create something truly special.\r\n\r\nFrom the moment you arrive, there is a sense of space and possibility. The main home offers three bedrooms, two bathrooms and a large, welcoming living area, with both front and rear decking providing the perfect settings for morning coffees, weekend entertaining or relaxing with family and friends.\r\n\r\nStep outside and discover a beautifully private rear garden, offering room for children to play, pets to enjoy and adults to unwind. This outdoor space invites you to slow down and enjoy home.\r\n\r\nBut what really sets this property apart is the additional accommodation.\r\n\r\nTucked away, the separate sleepout includes its own one bedroom, one bathroom, living area, and carport. Whether it becomes comfortable accommodation for extended family, a home office, a teenager's retreat or a flatmate space, the possibilities are as flexible as your lifestyle.\r\n\r\nWhen it comes to location, the appeal of Browns Bay is hard to overlook.\r\n\r\nEnjoy your morning coffee at a local café, browse the shops, meet friends for lunch or head down to the Browns Bay waterfront for a walk along the coast. With everyday conveniences and coastal enjoyment so close at hand, this is a location that makes it easy to embrace the relaxed North Shore lifestyle.\r\n\r\nFamilies are particularly well catered for, with Browns Bay School within walking distance and the property zoned for Rangitoto College, adding further appeal for those planning for the years ahead.\r\n\r\nWhether you're looking for more room for a growing family, a property that can accommodate loved ones, or simply a home where you can enjoy the very best of Browns Bay, this is an opportunity worth experiencing.\r\n\r\nCome for the space. Stay for the lifestyle. Make 2/12 Philson Terrace your next move.",
